Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 22:36:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 42/47] metal: lock inversion to ducc0, gate GPU hooks behind
 -mgpu

-mgpu now means GPU for prediction and deconvolution only. Metal
inversion only runs when MX_METAL_ENGINE=metal|cpu-vkfft is set
explicitly; otherwise ducc0 runs untouched. The peak-scan hook is
registered only when settings.useGpu is true, so the same binary
without -mgpu is pure CPU.

